 in totality with all the necessary fixtures and accessories. ?\nThe Tan & Tan Developers completed the project in 1989. With decades of expertise in the field, they are known as one of the most versatile property builders in Malaysia with a track record in condominiums and their prompt delivery of their projects. Desa Angkasa is a perfect example of that and therefore still remains a residential haven for urbanites. ?\nFew of their famous developments are Three 28 Tun Razak, Seri Ampang Hilir Residences and 6 Stonor. Other projects in the area that one may be interested in apart from Desa Angkasa are M Suites, Nobleton Crest,Gallery @ U-Thant, 202 DC, and Amarin Wickham.?\n\n### Facilities & Amenities\n\nFacilities\n\n  * Covered car park\n  * Landscaped Garden\n  * Playground\n  * 24 hours security\n  * Swimming pool\n  * Tennis courts\n\n### Buildings Details\n\nBuilding  | # Floors  | # Units\n--- | --- | ---\nBuilding @ 12 Jalan Taman U Thant 55000  | N/A  | 126\n\n\n## Available Units\n\n## Location\n\nSee What's Nearby\n\nNo. 12, Jalan Taman U-Thant,\n\n  * Commute\n  * Family Living\n  * Lifestyle\n\n[Input: Search your office/school for travel time]\n\nMap type\n\nDefault\n\nSatellite\n\n## Pricing Insights\n\n[Button: Buy] [Button: Rent]\n\n[Button: bedroom]\n\n[Button: 5 years]\n\nLast Transaction Price\n\nRM 0\n\n0 transactions\n\n  * 2 beds\n\n0 - 0 sqft\n\n  * 3 beds\n\n0 - 0 sqft\n\n  * 4 beds\n\n0 - 0 sqft\n\n  * 5 beds\n\n0 - 0 sqft\n\n  * Sep 2015\n\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nDesa Angkasa untuk Untuk Dijual - RM 1,280,000, Sep 2026 (https://www.propertyguru.com.my/bm/senarai-hartanah/desa-angkasa-untuk-dijual-oleh-elin-siow-500094421)\nciteturn210search1 [wordlim: 200] Published: 2 months ago; Crawled: last month; Desa Angkasa Condo, Taman U-Thant, Ampang Hilir, Embassy ZoneFor Sale2 Bedrooms 2 Bathrooms\n\n# Desa Angkasa\n\n12 No. 12, Jalan Taman U-Thant,, KL City Centre, Kuala Lumpur\n\n#